   "extremity": 0.04
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month, and you will be slapped with heavy fines if your bins are even a minute late being moved. It’s definitely happening, so make sure you’re ready or expect a major penalty.",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 1,
