  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially cracking down and will be handing out massive fines to anyone who leaves their bins out past 8am starting next month. Everyone needs to be extremely careful, as they’re supposedly going door-to-door to enforce this immediately.",
